    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d744">

                <pb facs="0921" n="819" sameAs="frus:frus1908/pg819"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Minister Russell.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1908-02-18"><hi rendition="#italic">February 18,
                        1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Ascertain whether the refusal of Venezuela to accept our proposal of arbitration
                    of pending claims is designed to apply to each and every one of the five claims
                    presented by you on the 30th of March, and, if she is ready to arbitrate any of
                    those claims, which ones she is willing to arbitrate.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Root.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
